<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 1.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Estonia's Kuku radio news report on Tuesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Tallinn central prison has new management.</p>
<p>- Hansapank will launch an internet banking project next Monday.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
